1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:03,000
Good morning, everyone.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:07,000
Please sit down.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
We have a lot to cover today.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
Mr. Hale, are you ready?

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
Yes, Your Honor.
I've been ready for weeks.

6
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Then call your first witness.

7
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
The defense calls Dr. Marlow.

8
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:31,000
Doctor, please state your name.

9
00:00:33,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Eleanor Marlow.

10
00:00:37,000 --> 00:00:39,000
And what do you do for a living?

11
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:43,000
I'm a surgeon at St. Anne's Hospital.

12
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:47,000
How long have you worked there?

13
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Twelve years this October.

14
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:55,000
Did you treat the patient
on the night in question?

15
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:59,000
I did.

16
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Tell us what happened.

17
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
He came in around midnight.

18
00:01:09,000 --> 00:01:11,000
He was pale and short of breath.

19
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
His wife said he'd collapsed
at dinner.

20
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:19,000
Did she say anything else?

21
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Objection. Hearsay.

22
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
I'll allow it.

23
00:01:29,000 --> 00:01:31,000
She said he'd been
feeling dizzy for days.

24
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,000
And did you run any tests?

25
00:01:37,000 --> 00:01:39,000
We ordered blood work
and a CT scan.

26
00:01:41,000 --> 00:01:43,000
What did the results show?

27
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:47,000
A blockage in the main artery.

28
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:51,000
That sounds serious.

29
00:01:53,000 --> 00:01:55,000
It was. We operated immediately.

30
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
Thank you, Doctor.
No further questions.

31
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:03,000
Ms. Reyes, your witness.

32
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:07,000
Thank you, Your Honor.

33
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:11,000
Dr. Marlow, you said
you operated at once.

34
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:15,000
That's correct.

35
00:02:17,000 --> 00:02:19,000
But the chart says
the surgery began at 3:40.

36
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
That's more than three hours later.

37
00:02:25,000 --> 00:02:27,000
We had to stabilize him first.

38
00:02:29,000 --> 00:02:31,000
Or you were waiting for
the senior surgeon to arrive.

39
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,000
That is not what happened.

40
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Then what did happen?

41
00:02:41,000 --> 00:02:43,000
[phone buzzing]

42
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Sorry, Your Honor.
I forgot to silence it.

43
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:51,000
Please do so now.

44
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
The delay was medical,
not administrative.

45
00:02:57,000 --> 00:02:59,000
I'd like to believe that, Doctor.

46
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,000
But the records say otherwise.

47
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:07,000
THIS COURT WILL COME TO ORDER.

48
00:03:09,000 --> 00:03:11,000
Counsel, approach the bench.

49
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Is there a problem, Your Honor?

50
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
Keep your questions
to the point, Ms. Reyes.

51
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Of course.

52
00:03:25,000 --> 00:03:27,000
I'll rephrase.

53
00:03:29,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Doctor, who authorized the delay?

54
00:03:33,000 --> 00:03:35,000
Dr. Whitfield did.

55
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:39,000
The head of surgery.

56
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,000
Yes. He was in the building,
but not in the room.

57
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,000
Interesting.

58
00:03:49,000 --> 00:03:51,000
No further questions.

59
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,000
We'll take a fifteen-minute recess.

60
00:03:57,000 --> 00:03:59,000
♪ [soft piano music] ♪

61
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,000
You did well in there.

62
00:04:05,000 --> 00:04:07,000
Did I? She tore me apart.

63
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:11,000
She asked what she needed to ask.

64
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:15,000
Now we have to fix it.

65
00:04:17,000 --> 00:04:19,000
How?

66
00:04:21,000 --> 00:04:23,000
We find Whitfield
before she does.

67
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:27,000
He won't talk to us.

68
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:31,000
Everyone talks eventually.

69
00:04:33,000 --> 00:04:35,000
That's what worries me.

70
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:39,000
Call his office.
Tell them it's urgent.

71
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,000
And if he refuses?

72
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:47,000
Then we subpoena him.

73
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
That could take days.

74
00:04:53,000 --> 00:04:55,000
We don't have days.
We have until Friday.

75
00:04:57,000 --> 00:04:59,000
Fine. I'll make the call.

76
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:03,000
Hello, this is Hale and Pierce.

77
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:07,000
We'd like to speak
with Dr. Whitfield.

78
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,000
He's in a meeting right now.

79
00:05:13,000 --> 00:05:15,000
Can you tell him it's about
the Anderson case?

80
00:05:17,000 --> 00:05:19,000
One moment, please.

81
00:05:21,000 --> 00:05:23,000
[line clicking]

82
00:05:25,000 --> 00:05:27,000
Dr. Whitfield will see you
at five o'clock.

83
00:05:29,000 --> 00:05:31,000
Thank you. We'll be there.

84
00:05:33,000 --> 00:05:35,000
That was easier than I expected.

85
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:39,000
Too easy, if you ask me.

86
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:43,000
You always say that.

87
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:47,000
And I'm usually right.

88
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:51,000
Let's get some coffee first.

89
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,000
I need to think.

90
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,000
You never stop thinking.

91
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,000
It's a curse, really.

92
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Do you have the file
on the Anderson surgery?

93
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:11,000
It's in my bag.
Eighty-two pages.

94
00:06:13,000 --> 00:06:15,000
Did you read all of it?

95
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Twice. Something doesn't add up.

96
00:06:21,000 --> 00:06:23,000
What do you mean?

97
00:06:25,000 --> 00:06:27,000
The anesthesia log is missing
forty minutes.

98
00:06:29,000 --> 00:06:31,000
Missing, or just not signed?

99
00:06:33,000 --> 00:06:35,000
Missing. Completely blank.

100
00:06:37,000 --> 00:06:39,000
Then we have our answer.
